Package: hscl-memory
Version: 0.0.0
Architecture: all
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: earlyoom, systemd-zram-generator
Maintainer: HCSMEDIA <noreply@hcsmedia.invalid>
Description: HSCL1 memory protection: compressed swap in RAM, early out-of-memory killer, AI memory slice
 Configures zram swap (zstd), a low-memory killer that spares the desktop shell,
 and a systemd slice that caps what local AI servers may use.
 The tuning values are common defaults and have not been benchmarked by HSCL1.
 Made with love by hcsmedia.
